# Heaven & Hell's town dialogue, from main's files/assets/dialogue/*.txt. This game has no speech, so no sfx.
# A line of just "+" starts a new paragraph. quests.rec decides who says what, when.

%rec: text

id: TEXT_HH_KIRIOTH_WELCOME
text: Welcome, my friend!
+
+ I am Kirioth, the eldest of this town.
+
+ You've come at the right time. Our town is under attack by demons and the living dead.
+
+ Please, enter the cathedral to the north-east of town and end this madness.
+
+ There is one particular dangerous demon on the second level of the cathedral.
+
+ You must defeat him to save our town!

id: TEXT_HH_KIRIOTH_MEAT_JACK
text: Please, that unholy abomination is still waiting on the second floor of the cathedral.
+
+ Hurry, before it's too late.

id: TEXT_HH_KIRIOTH_MEAT_JACK_REWARD
text: You've done us a great service, friend. Here, take this. It's the least I can do to thank you.

id: TEXT_HH_KIRIOTH_AFTER_MEAT_JACK
text: Thanks again, for helping us make this town safer for everyone.

id: TEXT_HH_KIRIOTH_LUCIFER_QUEST
text: It's all clear now.
+
+ It's him, it's always been him.
+
+ Beneath our very feet lies the answer to all our questions.
+
+ You must travel the caves that are located under the catacombs.
+
+ Find the entrance to hell itself and slay the devil.

id: TEXT_HH_KIRIOTH_LUCIFER_QUEST_REWARD
text: You've done it!
+
+ You've really done it!
+
+ Here, take this as an unworthy reward.

id: TEXT_HH_SHEKEL_WELCOME
text: Welcome, my friend!
+
+ I am Shekel, the leader of the merchants' guild.
+
+ These demons have been a plague on our town for some days now. It's getting worse by the hour.
+
+ Business has been slow, and customers are afraid to even enter the town.
+
+ I am currently investigating the source of this evil.
+
+ Come back later, and I will tell you what I have found.

id: TEXT_HH_SHEKEL_SKELETON_KING_QUEST
text: Ah, you've come at the right time.
+
+ My sources tell me, that the evil king Zedek has returned from the dead.
+
+ His tomb is on the fourth level, inside the catacombs.
+
+ You must find him and his devilish undead minions and destroy them once and for all.
+
+ Good luck, brave adventurer.

id: TEXT_HH_SHEKEL_SKELETON_KING_QUEST_REWARD
text: You've done well, my friend. You've done well.
+
+ Here is your reward.

id: TEXT_HH_SHEKEL_AFTER_SKELETON_KING
text: We owe you so much!

id: TEXT_HH_ABEL_WELCOME
text: Welcome, my brother!
+
+ I am Abel.
+
+ Bad things are happening in this town. I am sure you have heard of the abduction of Shekel's son Jim?
+
+ When you have dealt with the immediate threat, I have a request for you.
+
+ Please, kill that abomination that has been terrorizing our townsfolk.

id: TEXT_HH_ABEL_POISON_QUEST
text: Thanks for dealing with that monster.
+
+ There's still an issue of utmost importance that needs to be addressed.
+
+ For some weeks now our rivers have been polluted by a mysterious substance.
+
+ There are rumors that it's coming from the catacombs.
+
+ Please, find out what's going on. If there are any monsters down there, defeat them, and you'll be rewarded.

id: TEXT_HH_ABEL_POISON_QUEST_REWARD
text: You've been a great help.
+
+ Please, take this reward.

id: TEXT_HH_ABEL_AFTER_POISON_QUEST
text: Thanks for cleaning up the water.

id: TEXT_HH_MARY_WELCOME
text: Welcome, stranger.
+
+ I am sister Mary.
